# 🤖 `ai-ops-assistant` — AI Incident Diagnostic Assistant

Welcome to **`ai-ops-assistant`**! An AI agent using RAG and tool calling to diagnose operational incidents using live telemetry and architecture knowledge.

> **GitHub Repository URL**: [https://github.com/shivam-nitm/Flash_Sale_Platform/tree/main/ai-ops-assistant](https://github.com/shivam-nitm/Flash_Sale_Platform/tree/main/ai-ops-assistant)

---

## 🎯 Capabilities

1. **RAG Architecture**: Indexes ADRs, runbooks, and domain schemas into PgVector (**FR-017**).
2. **Diagnostic Tool Calling**:
   - `query_prometheus_metric(query)`
   - `get_trace_by_id(trace_id)`
   - `fetch_pod_logs(pod_name)`
